Lets requests set top-k between 1 and 20 on the Qwen3.8 Flash Next package. The stock package fixes every sampling
parameter, and Flare rejects temperature 0, so greedy decoding is unavailable; with this range, top-k 1 keeps only the
highest-scoring token. Defaults stay at temperature 1.0, top-p 0.95, top-k 20.

Applies to NVIDIA/flare-local-inference at 1fd1f917fcf2b0a48068e1f9e58be8db2165b383. The patched file is part of
Flare's Ignition and remains under the Apache License 2.0.

